  {
    "page": 7,
    "shapes": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "What is AI?",
        "bounds": [
          838200,
          365125,
          10515600,
          1325563
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "AI is a model of several animal psychological skills:\nKnowing\nRecognizing\nAttending\nActing\nLearning\nAs you will learn later, and unlike what you will hear from many people: How AI models each of these things is at least slightly based on how humans do each of these things. AI is NOT some kind of technical innovation that came out of nowhere. \n",
        "bounds": [
          838200,
          1825625,
          10515600,
          4351338
        ]
      }
    ],
    "speakerNotes": ""
  },
  {
    "page": 8,
    "shapes": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "How does AI know? ",
        "bounds": [
          838200,
          365125,
          11126492,
          1325563
        ]
