          365125,
          10515600,
          1325563
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "How does AI know?\nBy demonstrating the ability to complete or cloze sequences\nI can test your knowledge of a skill by asking you to complete some sequence\nAI: That is ALL what knowledge is: Completion!",
        "bounds": [
          5580681,
          4677313,
          6167034,
          2036109
        ]
      }
    ],
    "speakerNotes": ""
  },
  {
