        "type": "text",
        "text": "Well…\nThrough recognizing by computing\nWhat is this computing?\nMostly: +, - , × , ÷\nYes, Grade School Arithmetic! Sorry!\nThe knowledge by which the system transforms the x’s into the pdf is in a bunch of numbers called w’s , or weights\nToday’s AI systems have about a couple of trillions of these weights\n",
